		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A cloudy donut-shaped mist ring of alternating white and black stripes with four arms. Bizarre aeons that consume unnatural light and shadow.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 16, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 slam +3 (1d4), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Banish Darkness</strong>. Consume magical darkness, create a shockwave and near-width glow centered on aeon, all enemies CON 15+ or stunned 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Consume Light</strong>. Consume magical light, create a frigid chill and near-width darkness centered on aeon, all enemies CON 15+ or 2d6 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
